AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0410009> "The SoNS consists of afferent and efferent nerves. Afferent nerves are responsible for relaying sensation to the central nervous system; efferent nerves are responsible for stimulating muscle contraction, including all the non-sensory neurons connected with skeletal muscles and skin.")
