AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0410379> "Unlike in CD8+ T cells, in CD4+ T cells the populations of central memory, effector memory and TEMRA cells are not easily measurable and or are of limited clinical utility. Therefore, generally, only the distinction between naive and memory CD4 T cells is made.")
